OL,3,AMember of UK armed forces dies in road
OL,4,Atraffic incident in Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of the UK armed forces has
OL,7,Fdied in a road traffic incident in
OL,8,FUkraine, the Ministry of Defence (MoD)
OL,9,Fhas announced.
OL,11,FThe individual's family has been
OL,12,Finformed and has "requested a period of
OL,13,Fgrace before further details are
OL,14,Freleased", the MoD's statement said.
OL,16,FThe incident on Saturday was not the
OL,17,Fresult of hostile action, the BBC
OL,18,Funderstands.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
